{"version":1,"content":"<p>周星馳的新片《功夫女足》在海外口碑遭遇滑鐵盧。爛番茄最新數據顯示，該片新鮮度0%，成為該平台近年來罕見的零好評影片。據爛番茄，代表普通觀眾評分的爆米花指數尚未顯示，因為評價不滿50條；代表專業影評人評論的爛番茄指數為0%，共有12條評論。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1583906.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:31.726549+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:13:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:10.130405+00:00","content_hash":"486d4329039d05f12d76c111face76467ba20d5c204ff60d614431e04c4a5bf9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}